{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudslegacylayoutmodifier"]}],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Structure","title":"OUDSLegacyLayoutModifier","modules":[{"name":"Components"}],"role":"symbol","externalID":"s:14OUDSComponents24OUDSLegacyLayoutModifierV","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"OUDSLegacyLayoutModifier","kind":"identifier"}],"symbolKind":"struct","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSLegacyLayoutModifier","kind":"identifier"}]},"sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSLegacyLayoutModifier"},"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ViewModifier"},{"type":"text","text":" to manage an edge case about Liquid Glass configuration of Apple OS and Xcode versions."}],"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSLegacyLayoutModifier\/init()"],"generated":true,"title":"Initializers","anchor":"Initializers"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSLegacyLayoutModifier\/body(content:)"],"generated":true,"title":"Instance Methods","anchor":"Instance-Methods"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSLegacyLayoutModifier\/ViewModifier-Implementations"],"generated":true,"title":"Default Implementations","anchor":"Default-Implementations"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"text":"MainActor","kind":"attribute","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSLegacyLayoutModifier","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If an app is compiled with Xcode 27 for iOS 27, Liquid Glass is forced by the system and considered as enabled by OUDS."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"If an app is compiled with Xcode 26 for iOS 26, the "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"UIDesignRequiresCompatibility"}]},{"type":"text","text":" flag is read and OUDS considers wether or not Liquid Glass is enabled."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"If an app is compiled with Xcode 26 for iOS 18 and lower, Liquid Glass is considered as unavailable, disabled.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The edge case is when the OS version is 27, the flag "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"UIDesignRequiresCompatibility","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" stils exists but the app is compiled with Xcode 26."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This case is extreme: the system does not force Liquid Glass, the flag is here, and OUDS cannot only rely on the OS version."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Thus, this "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSLegacyLayoutModifier","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"  will define an environment value saying any legacy layout things (appearances, selector, divider) must be displayed."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"**You must use this "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ViewModifier"},{"type":"text","text":" with care, and only if you are using Xcode 26 and  "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"UIDesignRequiresCompatibility","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" to YES **."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Prefer build with Xcode 27 without the "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"UIDesignRequiresCompatibility","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":"  flag."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["  OUDSTabBar(selectedTab: ..., count: ...) { ... )","    .modifier(OUDSLegacyLayoutModifier())"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Note: You should use this view modifier in your root view because the flag it defines in deeper levels is used for all navigations components like bars","type":"text"}]}],"type":"paragraph"},{"style":"note","name":"Since","type":"aside","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"3.0.0","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents"]]},"relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/7SwiftUI12ViewModifierP"],"type":"conformsTo","title":"Conforms To"}],"references":{"doc://OUDSComponents/documentation/OUDSComponents":{"abstract":[{"text":"The catalog of all components provided by OUDS. It contains also ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"View"},{"type":"text","text":" extensions and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ViewModifiers"},{"type":"text","text":" to apply tokens and styles on components and higher-level views."}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents","url":"\/documentation\/oudscomponents","role":"collection","images":[{"type":"icon","identifier":"ic_folder_categories.png"}],"type":"topic","title":"Components"},"doc://OUDSComponents/documentation/OUDSComponents/OUDSLegacyLayoutModifier/ViewModifier-Implementations":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSLegacyLayoutModifier\/ViewModifier-Implementations","url":"\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudslegacylayoutmodifier\/viewmodifier-implementations","title":"ViewModifier Implementations","role":"collectionGroup","abstract":[],"type":"topic","kind":"article"},"doc://OUDSComponents/documentation/OUDSComponents/OUDSLegacyLayoutModifier":{"role":"symbol